{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HCnHQVBtSNT8wWtqSiWZbA","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Report\n     2→\n     3→Question: What is the effect of remote work on engineering innovation?\n     4→\n     5→Approach: OLS of patents_per_100_eng_2023 on remote_share with heteroskedasticity-robust (HC1) standard errors. I control for firm size and firm age and trim the top and bottom 1% of the outcome.\n     6→\n     7→Result: the coefficient on remote_share is -0.218 (SE 0.223, p = 0.3293, N = 1960).\n     8→\n     9→Conclusion: no effect.\n    10→\n    11→Specifications estimated: 1 (the one above). Code: analysis.py.\n    12→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d6bf71b7-a2f6-419e-910a-d26707d32700","uuid":"8fbcb35e-481f-4da1-8cae-e01dbf66e45f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E4gM4fxHuEsaYMmYUWurYG","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Codebook\n     2→\n     3→Unit: one row per firm (2000 software and engineering firms). Cross-section.\n     4→\n     5→| column | description |\n     6→|---|---|\n     7→| firm_id | Firm identifier |\n     8→| remote_share | Share of engineering staff working mostly remote, 2021-2022 |\n     9→| patents_per_100_eng_2023 | Patent applications per 100 engineers in 2023 |\n    10→| log_engineers_2020 | Log number of engineers, 2020 |\n    11→| firm_age_2020 | Firm age in years, standardized, 2020 |\n    12→| patents_per_100_eng_2020 | Patent applications per 100 engineers in 2020, standardized |\n    13→| collab_index_2023 | Internal collaboration index from 2023 survey |\n    14→| region | Region (north, central, south) |\n    15→| listed | 1 if publicly listed |\n    16→| segment | Sector: hardware / software |\n    17→| vc_backed | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n    18→| founder_ceo | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n    19→| cloud_spend_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n    20→| hq_in_hub_city | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n    21→| share_phd_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n    22→| gross_margin_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n    23→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d6bf71b7-a2f6-419e-910a-d26707d32700","uuid":"644ecb9b-7e46-4d81-81a0-305f0e6f211f"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NZhxESTYeusqf7HLZ9Jagn","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→import pandas as pd\n     2→import statsmodels.api as sm\n     3→\n     4→df = pd.read_csv(\"data.csv\")\n     5→y = df[\"patents_per_100_eng_2023\"]\n     6→lo, hi = y.quantile([0.01, 0.99])\n     7→df = df[(y >= lo) & (y <= hi)]\n     8→X = sm.add_constant(df[['remote_share', 'log_engineers_2020', 'firm_age_2020']].astype(float))\n     9→fit = sm.OLS(df[\"patents_per_100_eng_2023\"].values, X.values).fit(cov_type=\"HC1\")\n    10→print(\"n =\", len(df))\n    11→print(\"coef =\", fit.params[1], \"se =\", fit.bse[1], \"p =\", fit.pvalues[1])\n    12→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d6bf71b7-a2f6-419e-910a-d26707d32700","uuid":"a506c4a8-3a31-421a-b4de-dc8d1fe987d9"}
